eld.', 'zh-Hans': '此字段必须为对象。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.array': {'en': 'An array is required; questions and dimensions must not be empty.', 'zh-Hans': '此字段必须为数组；题目与维度不能为空。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.required': {'en': 'This text field is required.', 'zh-Hans': '此文本字段必填。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.type': {'en': 'This value type is not supported by the local preview. The original text is retained.', 'zh-Hans': '本地预览尚不支持此值类型，原文已保留。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.true': {'en': 'This declaration must be true.', 'zh-Hans': '此声明必须为 true。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.duplicate': {'en': 'Keys or dimensions must be unique in their scope.', 'zh-Hans': 'key 或维度在所属范围内不得重复。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.tiebreak': {'en': 'Multiple dimensions require a tiebreak question.', 'zh-Hans': '多个维度必须配置并列取舍题。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.results': {'en': 'Result keys must match the declared dimensions exactly.', 'zh-Hans': '结果分支 key 必须与已声明维度一一对应。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.coupon': {'en': 'All results must not use the same coupon.', 'zh-Hans': '所有结果不能绑定同一优惠券。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.tag': {'en': 'Only space_constraints, social_mode, arrival_window and expression_mode tags are supported.', 'zh-Hans': '标签仅支持 space_constraints、social_mode、arrival_window、expression_mode。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.stepType': {'en': 'Question type must be single or discard.', 'zh-Hans': '题目类型必须为 single 或 discard。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.options': {'en': 'Each question needs at least two options.', 'zh-Hans': '每道题至少需要两个选项。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.score': {'en': 'Scores must name declared dimensions and use JSON integers from 0 to 2.', 'zh-Hans': '分值必须对应已声明维度，并使用 0 到 2 的 JSON 整数。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.evidence': {'en': 'The result body must include {{choices}} as the choice evidence.', 'zh-Hans': '结果 body 必须包含 {{choices}} 选择依据。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.days': {'en': 'nextStepDays must be the JSON integer 7 or 30.', 'zh-Hans': 'nextStepDays 必须为 JSON 整数 7 或 30。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.combinations': {'en': 'More than 4096 ordinary combinations: split the questionnaire as required by the server contract.', 'zh-Hans': '普通选项组合超过 4096，请按服务端规则拆分题组。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.tie': {'en': 'At least one tiebreak option can still leave a tie.', 'zh-Hans': '至少一个并列取舍选项仍可能打平。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.error.reachable': {'en': 'Every declared dimension must be able to win uniquely.', 'zh-Hans': '每个已声明维度都必须可以唯一胜出。'}, 'templateAuthor.preference.editorTitle': {'en': 'Preference questionnaire configuration', 'zh-Hans': '偏好题组配置'}, 'templateAuthor.optionMedia.audio': {'en': 'Audio reference', 'zh-Hans': '音频地址'}, 'templateAuthor.optionMedia.img': {'en': 'Image reference', 'zh-Hans': '图片地址'}, 'templateAuthor.optionMedia.limit': {'en': 'Use at most 500 UTF-16 units per reference and 2,000 for all attachment data. This edit was not applied.', 'zh-Hans': '每个地址最多 500 个 UTF-16 单元，全部附件数据最多 2,000 个。本次修改未应用。'}, 'templateAuthor.optionMedia.scope': {'en': 'Image and audio references stay attached to choices A–D. These fields do not upload, fetch, or play media.', 'zh-Hans': '图片和音频地址按 A–D 选项保存。此处不上传、加载或播放媒体。'}, 'templateAuthor.optionMedia.title': {'en': 'Choice attachments', 'zh-Hans': '选项附件'}, 'templateAuthor.optionMedia.unsupported': {'en': 'This saved attachment data has an unsupported format. It is preserved unchanged and cannot be edited here.', 'zh-Hans': '已保存的附件数据格式暂不支持。原数据保持不变，此处无法编辑。'}} : templateAuthor.entryFlow

